 "questionType": "단답형",
 "content": "다음을 전개하시오.\n⑴ $6b(2b-5)$ ⑵ $-4x(5x+7y)$\n⑶ $5a(a-2b+6)$ ⑷ $(7x-6y+1)\\times(-3x)$",
 "choices": [],
 "answer": "⑴ $12b^{2}-30b$ ⑵ $-20x^{2}-28xy$ ⑶ $5a^{2}-10ab+30a$ ⑷ $-21x^{2}+18xy-3x$",
 "solution": "⑴ $6b\\times 2b-6b\\times 5=12b^{2}-30b$이다.\n⑵ $-4x\\times 5x+(-4x)\\times 7y=-20x^{2}-28xy$이다.\n⑶ $5a\\times a-5a\\times 2b+5a\\times 6=5a^{2}-10ab+30a$이다.\n⑷ $7x\\times(-3x)-6y\\times(-3x)+1\\times(-3x)=-21x^{2}+18xy-3x$이다.",
 "score": null,
